    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Type Ride&quot;</strong> is a typing-based tower defense game where you summon units by typing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonist, once known as the &quot;Type Rider&quot; for her high-speed typing skills while riding a motorcycle, has been tasked with resolving issues in a world overrun by ink lifeforms. She decides to ride her beloved bike once again.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build Your Unique Deck</strong>: Construct your own deck with over 50 unique ink monsters, each possessing various elements such as attributes, classes, and special skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Typing Summons</strong>: A system where you summon ink monsters by successfully typing. Counter the approaching ink lifeforms by summoning your own creatures.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Battles</strong>: Use the order of summoning and spell cards strategically to gain an advantage in battle.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Type Ride&quot;</strong> is a typing-based tower defense game where you summon units by typing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonist, once known as the &quot;Type Rider&quot; for her high-speed typing skills while riding a motorcycle, has been tasked with resolving issues in a world overrun by ink lifeforms. She decides to ride her beloved bike once again.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build Your Unique Deck</strong>: Construct your own deck with over 50 unique ink monsters, each possessing various elements such as attributes, classes, and special skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Typing Summons</strong>: A system where you summon ink monsters by successfully typing. Counter the approaching ink lifeforms by summoning your own creatures.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Battles</strong>: Use the order of summoning and spell cards strategically to gain an advantage in battle.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "&quot;Type Ride&quot; is a typing-based tower defense game where you summon units by typing. In a world overrun by ink lifeforms, the protagonist\u2014once known as the &quot;Type Rider&quot; for her high-speed typing skills while riding a motorcycle\u2014decides to ride her beloved bike once again to resolve the chaos.",
